{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52568","headline":"陆浑南桃花汤 · 宋之问","name":"陆浑南桃花汤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"氛氲桃花汤，去都三百里。\n远峯益稠沓，具物尽奇诡。\n借问采药人，冥奥从此始。\n汨吾尚清净，荤血久誓止。\n览彼□□鲜，自谓形骸滓。\n重敦永劫愿，无负神泉水。\n坐驰意屡惬，身践心益死。\n长妹梵筵衆，拙妻道门子。\n提携游二山，岁暮此已矣。\n（同前第二一八八页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}